# Scene 3: The dashboard. Admin office; M. Jlassi, on speaker.
# Core; trade-off vote. The dashboard stays on screen from here on.

~ start
M. Jlassi: The region tracks every centre on a dashboard during exam week. What will yours report?
do GameState.show_dashboard()
do Story.show_card(4)
Which metrics feed your dashboard?
- Supervisors present each day.
	do GameState.record_vote(3, "A")
	do GameState.team += 10
	do GameState.set_flag("metrics_people")
	do GameState.light_meter("team")
	M. Jlassi: People count. But will you see a late paper on that?
- Papers started on time, incidents logged, fraud cases detected.
	do GameState.record_vote(3, "B")
	do GameState.integrity += 10
	do GameState.set_flag("metrics_exam")
	do GameState.light_meter("integrity")
	do GameState.light_meter("fairness")
	M. Jlassi: That's what the region needs.
- The centre's pass rate.
	do GameState.record_vote(3, "C")
	do GameState.set_flag("metrics_passrate")
	do GameState.light_meter("integrity")
	do GameState.light_meter("fairness")
	do GameState.light_meter("team")
	do GameState.light_meter("budget")
	M. Jlassi: Fine, fine.
=> END
